### Kayıt ol
POST http://127.0.0.1:5003/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john@doe.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Aynı e-postayla tekrar kayıt (409 beklenir)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5003/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Again",
    "email": "JOHN@doe.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Hatalı kayıt (400 beklenir)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5003/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "email": "not-an-email",
    "password": "123"
}

### Yanlış şifreyle giriş (401 beklenir)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5003/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "john@doe.com",
    "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Giriş yap (cevaptaki token'ı aşağıda otomatik kullanacağız)
# @name login
POST http://127.0.0.1:5003/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "john@doe.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Token ile korumalı sayfa (200 beklenir)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5003/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Token olmadan (401 beklenir)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5003/me

### Sahte token ile (401 beklenir)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5003/me
Authorization: Bearer sahte.token.burada


### Yapılacak oluştur (John)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Buy groceries",
    "description": "Buy milk, eggs, and bread"
}

### İkinci yapılacak (John)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Pay bills",
    "description": "Pay electricity and water bills"
}

### Listele (sayfa 1, limit 1)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos?page=1&limit=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Ara
GET http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos?term=milk
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Güncelle (John kendi yapılacağını)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Buy groceries",
    "description": "Buy milk, eggs, bread, and cheese"
}

### İkinci kullanıcı kaydı (Jane)
# @name jane
POST http://127.0.0.1:5003/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Jane Doe",
    "email": "jane@doe.com",
    "password": "password456"
}

### Jane, John'un yapılacağını güncellemeye çalışır (403 beklenir)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{jane.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Hacked",
    "description": "Not yours"
}

### Jane, John'un yapılacağını silmeye çalışır (403 beklenir)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{jane.response.body.token}}

### Jane'in listesi (boş olmalı)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{jane.response.body.token}}

### John kendi yapılacağını siler (204 beklenir)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Olmayan yapılacak (404 beklenir)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5003/todos/999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}